host Vultr SEA NixOS VPS ai-jail pier (Daylight DC-1 hand) -- Eastern (EDT)
title Caravan redress -- a meeting says what it found, rather than closing the question in silence
prompt Keaton set the loop running: be Kyri in Radiant Style, read the card and the itineraries, close any agent-closable red first, then take the next agent-doable lap Lindy-first crux-first, prove it on metal, sweep the prose, and send it as its own signed round.
think Standfast first. The living reds ledger reads six rows and every one of them CLOSED -- %96, %97, %81, %84 -- and `reds_ledger_scan.sh` answers `verdict=ok` at 16488 bytes, under its 24576 bound. No open agent-closable red stands, so the line is clear for constructive work.
think The running thread came from the top of the log index and the newest recommend, which named the next crux in its own words: the meet rung makes a run take up the admission it inherited, receipt it, and take it down -- and the receipt says nothing whatever about what the look found. So a plan may meet every debt it ever books, change not one thing about the work, and read as perfectly answerable forever.
think The council rota, cycled by the 78-rung choir count (78 mod 27 = 24), landed on `active-designing/20260702-184312_the-grain-and-the-crossing.md`. Its test governed this lap: does every sentence of the design cut with a named strand of the grain? Bounded everything, values apart never braided, witnesses first, accrete never break -- the rung was designed against that list before a byte was written.
think The word came from the Comlink tendency: clearest, most fun, safest plain word for what a run owes an admission it has finally looked at. **Redress** is the plain word for setting right, it collides with nothing seated in the tree, and it says exactly what the rung is for.
think The design took its teeth from where a claim can actually be checked. Two upshots, `sound` and `righted`, both of which honestly close the question -- the harm named is the meeting that comes to neither and says so nowhere. Then the asymmetry: the stronger claim bears the burden, so `righted` refuses from a run whose own outcome reports itself short, while `sound` carries no such burden. Putting a burden on both would have taught every supervisor to say nothing at all, which is the very harm this rung names.
think Ordering: the redress runs after the meeting and reads that meeting's own receipt off the wire, never a remembered one -- so a run that met nothing writes nothing at all, which is the honest ending rather than a silence dressed as a finding. The receipt is left exactly where the rung below wrote it, since a redress reports on a meeting rather than replacing one; both notes stand together and a later reader lays them side by side.
think The accrete was mechanical where it should be and hand-written where it matters: `meet.rye` copied, the below-rung wrappers repointed at meet, the report chain deepened by one tier with a new `meet_of` reach, and then this rung's own section, note helpers, run step, folds, and wire check written fresh.
think Both measured runs now meet the inherited debt and take it down, so every number of the rung below stands still and only this lap's own three move. The bare run is deliberately given a word ready and never says it -- the sharpest form of the harm.
obs Five refusals reached on metal by name before the witness claimed GREEN -- RedressMisrecorded from a skipped write with the read-back armed, RedressUnmet from a receipt read as absent, RedressUnrighted from the stronger claim under a short outcome, RedressMismatched from a finding filed against another meeting, RedressMiscounted from one meeting counted twice.
obs The sixth RED path is the planted control: with the write skipped, the read-back dropped, and the harness's own two reads removed, the selftest printed GREEN while `caravan/.redresses/plan.redress` did not exist at all. Seeing that is what makes the reading back a check rather than decoration.
obs The lap left the ratchet cleaner than it found it. `tell_redress_half` had grown to 102 lines, so the telling split twice at real seams -- where the arc's inherited counts end and this lap's own begin, and where the quarrel's own record ends and the case carried outside it begins -- and the two new folds chained off the rung below the way the arc already chains, which brought `run_self_test` back under bound too. No Caravan ratchet is reported at all now.
loom witness=caravan_redress_witness verdict=GREEN rungs_in_choir=79 red_paths_on_metal=6 refusals=5 redress_bytes=3
loom measured=redress_two_runs phases=6 dependents=6 redressed=0_to_1 bare=1_to_0 hollow=1_to_0 met=1_and_1 every_other_number=unchanged
loom suite=caravan_suite_witness rungs=79 verdict=GREEN cold_tree=yes
file caravan/redress.rye the rung -- two upshots, the stronger claim's burden, five refusals, the finding written beside the receipt it reports on
file tools/caravan_redress_witness.rish the witness -- claims read natively, six RED paths named, the planted control described
file tools/caravan_suite_witness.rish registers the rung in the choir, which now sings 79
file caravan/README.md the durable per-rung record, so the prose outlives the card
file crux/REMEMBER.md live edge refreshed; the meet rung folded down to the prior-edges pointer
recommend keep-going the arc now corrects a record, carries the correction, hears the answer, records the disagreement, escorts the word, bounds the objection, stands its standing, tells the raiser, reads their reply, carries a live quarrel past the run that heard it, makes the inheriting run answer for it, lets its holder close it, dates it, reads that age aloud, puts a long-standing one before a third hand, reads back what that hand made of it, makes the plan answer that finding on the record, carries the plan's own concession forward, makes the run that inherits it meet it, and now makes that meeting say what it found -- so the question above is who ever reads the answer: a finding sits in the plan's own notes where only the plan looks, and the reader who raised the quarrel in the first place is never told that the admission they won was finally acted on, which means the whole arc can run to its end with the one person it was for never hearing a word of it.
